{"speciesId":760,"names":{"fr":"Chelours","es":"Bewear","en":"Bewear","ja":"キテルグマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa force physique hors norme le rend assez dangereux. D’ailleurs, les zones qu’il habite sont systématiquement interdites d’accès."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es un Pokémon muy peligroso por su fuerza descomunal. Normalmente, se desaconseja penetrar en su hábitat."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This immensely dangerous Pokémon possesses overwhelming physical strength. Its habitat is generally off-limits."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"圧倒的な 筋力を 持つ 非常に 危険な ポケモン。 生息地は 基本 立ち入り禁止。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il fête chaque victoire par une accolade avec son Dresseur, au grand dam de ce dernier, et en particulier de sa colonne vertébrale."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Expresa su afecto abrazando a sus amigos, aunque más de un Entrenador ha terminado con la espalda hecha polvo debido a esto."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon has the habit of hugging its companions. Many Trainers have left this world after their spines were squashed by its hug."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"仲間と 抱きしめあう くせが ある。 その力で 背骨を 砕かれて 世を 去る トレーナーも 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il fait de grands gestes avec ses pattes pour intimider et mettre en garde ses ennemis. Mieux vaut alors prendre ses jambes à son cou !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Agita violentamente los brazos como amenaza. Quien presencie este gesto debe huir en el acto si aprecia su vida."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It waves its hands wildly in intimidation and warning. Life is over for anyone who doesn’t run away as fast as possible."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"大きく 手を 振るのは 威嚇と 警戒の サイン。 一刻も 早く 逃げないと 命は ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa force colossale fait sa fierté. De nombreuses personnes le considèrent comme le Pokémon le plus dangereux d’Alola."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Está orgulloso de su fuerza bruta. Son muchos los que lo consideran el Pokémon más peligroso de Alola."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It boasts tremendous physical strength. Many people call it the most dangerous Pokémon in the Alola region."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"すさまじい 怪力が 自慢。 アローラ地方で もっとも 危険な ポケモンと 呼ぶ 人も 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il serre fort contre lui ceux qu’il considère comme ses compagnons, mais ses câlins sont assez puissants pour broyer les os."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Expresa su afecto abrazando a quien considera su amigo. Una costumbre peligrosa, ya que su fuerza puede romperle los huesos a cualquiera."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Once it accepts you as a friend, it tries to show its affection with a hug. Letting it do that is dangerous—it could easily shatter your bones."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"仲間と 認めると 愛情を 示すために 抱きしめようとするが 骨を 砕かれるので 危険。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il abat ses proies à l’aide de techniques à faire pâlir d’envie des combattants professionnels, puis les emporte sous les bras dans sa tanière."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Después de abatir a su presa con movimientos que harían palidecer a un luchador profesional, la carga en brazos y se la lleva a su madriguera."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The moves it uses to take down its prey would make a martial artist jealous. It tucks subdued prey under its arms to carry them to its nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"格闘家 顔負けの 技で 仕留めた 獲物を 両脇に 抱えて すみかへ 持ち帰る。"}],"varieties":[{"id":760,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[1